; Bruiser — AttackLibrary.
; Slow startup, devastating knockback. Every move is a commitment.
; ForwardSmash kills mid-stage around 90% — the entire neutral game exists to land it.
;
; Balance philosophy:
;   Jab        : slow but true combo starter at 0–30%.
;   BodySlam   : forward tilt with horizontal spike angle; wall-of-pain tool.
;   GroundPound: frame 21+, a spike aerial. Used off-stage only.
;   ForwardSmash: the win condition. Unsafe on shield, rewarded on read.
[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="AttackLibrary" load_steps=12 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Scripts/Character/Combat/AttackLibrary.cs" id="Script_AttackLibrary"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Scripts/Character/Combat/AttackData.cs"    id="Script_AttackData"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Scripts/Character/Combat/HitboxData.cs"    id="Script_HitboxData"]

